-- Read-only probe for the issue #7 room chain on AvevaMarineSample.
--
-- 24381/35842 = FRMW /1RX-RM05-R512, the only room whose panel list contains
-- 24381/35844, the very panel that issue #7's deleted edge pointed at
-- (room_relate id 24381_35844_24383_66460).
--
-- Nothing here mutates the project: no attribute write, no SAVEWORK.
--
-- Keep every "--" at the start of its own line: PML treats it as a comment
-- opener anywhere on a line, so "$P --- x ---" leaves $P with no argument and
-- fails the whole macro.

ALPHA LOG "D:/work/plant-code/old/gen-model/scripts/e3d/codex_room_probe.log" OVER
$P CODEX_ROOM_PROBE_BEGIN
$P SECTION_ROOM_FRMW_24381_35842
=24381/35842
Q CE
Q TYPE
Q NAME
Q OWNE
Q MEMB
$P SECTION_PANEL_PANE_24381_35844
=24381/35844
Q CE
Q TYPE
Q NAME
Q OWNE
Q POS
Q MEMB
$P SECTION_DAMP_24381_100819
=24381/100819
Q CE
Q TYPE
Q NAME
Q OWNE
Q POS
$P CODEX_ROOM_PROBE_DONE
ALPHA LOG END
